# Category: functions, errors
to greet who
    say "Hello" who
.
greet "Ada"
to addNumbers x and y
    return x plus y
.
r1 is addNumbers 3 and 4
say r1
addNumbers 3 4 make r2
say r2
addNumbers 5 6 into r3
say r3
to fact n
    if n is at most 1
        return 1
    .
    m is n minus 1
    r is fact m
    return n times r
.
say fact 5
to early v
    if v is 0
        stop
    .
    say "not stopped"
.
early 0
early 1
try
    fail with "custom failure"
otherwise into reason
    say "caught:" reason
.
try
    z is 1 divided by 0
otherwise
    say "caught without reason"
.
try
    fail with "swallowed"
.
say "after swallow"
